        "slc_b67eb6059deba0fbf6b03b39894b4f9c4207f3159a58dfd89b8013a2640d573b"
      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: upstream WezTerm fixes are backported weekly via a read-only tracking ref with manual per-commit ports tagged `Upstream-WezTerm: <sha>`; blind pulls, merges, or bulk directory copies from upstream are prohibited."
    },
