      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2e5ce6be9d078753c088f5845b0183980bb19ee7067e5543eea6ea3c862c009b"
      ],
      "text": "The stdio MCP transport (`ft mcp serve`) inherits the OS uid/gid with no in-band authentication, while MCP tool inputs are validated via workspace containment, size caps, and approval gating on mutating tools."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
