        "slc_4ecb16336b16aef1f753d678d49606367bebfae7794a9d23d6846970fa4a437b"
      ],
      "text": "`ft` runs as the invoking user with no privilege separation; captured terminal bytes are redacted only on read surfaces, with the on-disk SQLite store holding raw bytes protected by file permissions."
    },
